sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor E as Employee / Manager
  participant W as React (Nginx)
  participant LV as Leave Service
  participant HR as HR Service
  participant DB as Leave_DB
  E->>W: Chọn loại nghỉ, ngày và lý do
  W->>LV: POST /leave-api/api/v1/leave-requests (Bearer JWT)
  LV->>LV: Validate JWT, leaves.create:Self và input
  LV->>HR: GET /api/v1/lookup/employees/{callerId}
  HR-->>LV: Employee active, ManagerId, DepartmentId
  LV->>HR: GET /api/v1/leave-types/{id}?authoritative=true
  HR-->>LV: LeaveType active, DeductsBalance
  LV->>HR: GET /api/v1/holidays?from=&to=&authoritative=true
  HR-->>LV: Holidays trong date range
  opt Leave type trừ quota
    LV->>HR: GET /api/v1/leave-policies?year={year}&authoritative=true
    HR-->>LV: Policy quota authoritative cho từng năm
  end
  Note over LV,HR: HR authoritative reads bypass Redis; HTTP timeout 5 giây.
  opt HR lỗi hoặc timeout
    LV-->>W: 503 Dependency unavailable; không ghi Leave DB
  end
  LV->>LV: Tính weekdays trừ holidays và yearly allocations
  LV->>DB: BEGIN SERIALIZABLE transaction
  LV->>DB: Kiểm tra overlap Pending/Approved
  LV->>DB: Đọc hoặc tạo LeaveBalance theo Employee/LeaveType/Year
  LV->>DB: Refresh Entitled từ policy HR authoritative
  LV->>DB: Giữ nguyên Used/Pending; kiểm tra quota mới >= Used + Pending
  LV->>DB: Kiểm tra Entitled - Used - Pending
  alt Overlap, thiếu quota hoặc concurrent conflict
    LV->>DB: ROLLBACK
    LV-->>W: 409 / 422 ProblemDetails
  else Hợp lệ
    LV->>DB: INSERT LeaveRequest (Pending, HR snapshot)
    LV->>DB: INSERT LeaveRequestYearAllocation theo năm
    opt Leave type trừ quota
      LV->>DB: UPDATE LeaveBalance: Pending += allocation days
    end
    LV->>DB: INSERT LeaveRequestHistory (Created)
    LV->>DB: COMMIT
    LV-->>W: 201 Created + response
  end
  W-->>E: Hiển thị kết quả
